[{"title":"春日送立雨叔读书赤桥四首 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"汉家见说启青宫，少海谈经诏九重。\n此日蓬门须努力，未央鸣佩听晨钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江参军还金陵 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"十载京华白发生，归来海上结鸥盟。\n长江春水桃花发，又逐孤帆下石城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江参军还金陵 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"三月杨花扑酒香，扁舟春水别河梁。\n销魂漫拟江淹赋，家住金陵亦故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江参军还金陵 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"金阙连云压翠微，先皇敕赐有光辉。\n欲随绛节朝元去，目断天心一鹤飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙寺","author":"佘翔","text":"几度探春路不迷，寻僧又过竹林西。\n深山尽日无人到，双树阴中一鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"一代文章擅国工，弇州四部古谁同。\n自从授得刀圭诀，名在丹台玉籍中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"星罗北斗照乾坤，七子先朝集蓟门。\n独拥金仙朝五岳，至今谁不让昆崙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"词赋流传遍九垓，嵚崎历落见仙才。\n若非长史人间住，沧海谁看水一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"斋心日礼上清家，王母书传萼绿华。\n欲拜下风称弟子，鍊成勾漏旧丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"诏起西曹法从班，殷勤累疏乞东山。\n谢公总系苍生望，?得明时但闭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其六","author":"佘翔","text":"丝纶日下九重频，耆德三朝重老臣。\n若学五湖游不返，汉家谁复画麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王弇州先生 其七","author":"佘翔","text":"神如秋水映芙蓉，懒著朝衣听晓钟。\n笑问仙风谁得似，茅家兄弟跨双龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立朝叔亭子 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"一庭春色报芳菲，酒熟床头鳜乍肥。\n但得看花频中酒，百年长制薜萝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立朝叔亭子 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"座上青山一片孤，夜来月白似冰壶。\n接䍦倒著如泥醉，不管傍人说酒徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立朝叔亭子 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"白眼猖狂避世心，蓬池谁解阮公吟。\n仲容亦是逃名者，浊酒相看竹下斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪鲁狂","author":"佘翔","text":"仙人跨鹤下黄山，曳杖逍遥天地间。\n曾采三花栖少室，即今白发驻红颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剑浦对月呈陈观甫","author":"佘翔","text":"津口潺湲万壑哀，城头玉女弄珠来。\n依然狱底双龙剑，千载何人复姓雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮留云阁感怀 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"二月花间黄鸟啼，看花人去草萋萋。\n白云犹似能留客，一片飞来雨石西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮留云阁感怀 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"东山春色挂城头，依旧云霞槛外浮。\n别墅弹棋声寂寂，羊昙双泪为谁流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮留云阁感怀 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"乌石山前草阁孤，风流曾集竹林徒。\n重来多少伤心事，眼底山河邈酒垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄怀陆使君 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"郡阁三年集凤凰，颍川经术汉循良。\n翩翩车骑趋朝日，共识司徒旧省郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄怀陆使君 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"桑柘春生十万家，蓼萧赐燕日光华。\n闽南父老应相慰，行雨还来太守车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄怀陆使君 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"木兰陂上麦如云，露冕风流忆使君。\n一自单车俄入郡，讴歌何处不相闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄怀陆使君 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"计吏从容下建章，紫衣春染御炉香。\n乘风若渡巴陵水，莫为江鱼恋武昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日寄怀陆使君 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"白雪泠泠和者稀，郢中云树望依微。\n汉阳春水茫茫绿，何处仙帆一片飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀柯尧锡","author":"佘翔","text":"文藻翩翩锦不如，江湖风雨怅离居。\n长卿不是临邛客，谁向云霄荐子虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠林敷毅 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"何人意气薄青云，公子翩翩独有君。\n客到高斋频下榻，一尊风雨细论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠林敷毅 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"楚楚声华动五陵，清标直似玉壶冰。\n交游不少纵横客，最爱风流御李膺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中招廷珍","author":"佘翔","text":"细雨飘来二月花，美人何处斗豪华。\n囊中剩有青铜在，迟尔南邻卖酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蔡比部 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"才名矫矫擅谈天，瘴海风尘谪几年。\n憔悴无劳渔父问，三闾心事总堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蔡比部 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"天涯犹自梦鹓班，彭蠡风高一雁还。\n行色萧条无长物，逢人但说武夷山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南山寺","author":"佘翔","text":"山色迎人兴不孤，白云片片散浮屠。\n一尊浊酒?沉醉，箕踞山间听鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和郑给舍七夕对雨 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"木叶萧萧送雨声，明河风浪暗中生。\n人间尽道天孙巧，机杼空含此夜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和郑给舍七夕对雨 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"飞来暮雨妒婵娟，隔岁星期一水悬。\n却恨云间青鸟使，衔书不向月中传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丰城舟中有感","author":"佘翔","text":"城下江流带夕晖，城边云树望依微。\n当年狱底雌雄剑，不识今从何处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈尧勋云来阁 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"梅峰山下草堂清，书带参差绕砌生。\n一自青藜分太乙，彩毫何处不纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈尧勋云来阁 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"结屋壶公兴有馀，满床堆得读残书。\n即今不尽南阳泪，云满空山一草庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠漪亭","author":"佘翔","text":"草阁玲珑俯碧池，翠云低压万年枝。\n床头浊酒葡萄色，醉倒山公白接䍦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别林及甫 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"岁暮相逢雨雪多，春风曾奈别离何。\n解衣不为垆头酒，白眼看人一醉歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别林及甫 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"按剑风尘祗自愁，嗟君也敝黑貂裘。\n怀中十五连城璧，不是相知未可投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题元妙观五松","author":"佘翔","text":"谁种长松礼斗坛，五株曾否拜秦官。\n凉风吹上松梢月，影落龙鳞片片寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"东风乍转柳条新，尔去重扬蓟北尘。\n击筑若逢屠狗者，酒中谁是和歌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"陈遵结侠起高名，尺牍题来慰友生。\n不比当年惊座者，风流到处动公卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"囊里惟藏鸟篆文，江湖谁不识夫君。\n北游燕赵南吴楚，奇字偏劳问子云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"笔阵相传自永和，右军书法更谁过。\n黄庭写赠清狂客，不为山阴换白鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"沽来浊酒意如何，半醉当筵一放歌。\n江上千条彭泽柳，不知曾似客愁多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别陈本容 其六","author":"佘翔","text":"桃花美酒醉名姬，裘马长安二月时。\n妻子鹿门归自好，天涯风雨莫教迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题清樾轩","author":"佘翔","text":"结得高斋赋考槃，林间新著竹皮冠。\n白云犹带苍梧色，散作清阴六月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁使君平寇歌 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"南国烽烟拥二酋，皖城千雉望旄头。\n地当三辅惊多垒，谁向军中借箸筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁使君平寇歌 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"幕府临戎气拔旌，欃枪入夜照连营。\n佩刀直抵沙中去，誓斩鲸鲵一洗兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁使君平寇歌 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"潢池何事弄干戈，陈汉山中啸聚多。\n不是使君承庙略，居人曾奈麦秋何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁使君平寇歌 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"天柱崔嵬控上游，长江东下堑皇州。\n荆舒一战鞬櫜卧，南顾无劳圣主忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁使君平寇歌 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"绿林扫尽凯歌还，父老壶浆皖水边。\n见说禁中思颇牧，试看勋业上凌烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"义帝陵","author":"佘翔","text":"牧羊何意起民间，祸隐当年遣入关。\n千古兴亡君莫问，江东曾见一人还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望庐山","author":"佘翔","text":"庐岳崚嶒五老峰，鄱阳秋水浸芙蓉。\n凌风欲挟飞鸾去，坐听天池万壑钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别吴文中 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"逍遥初谒武夷君，玉女峰头弄白云。\n归去扁舟图九曲，幔亭仙乐夜深闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别吴文中 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"南国山川似洛中，官桥截海驾长虹。\n蛎螃正美新荔熟，系马垆头醉晚枫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别吴文中 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"黄花采采报重阳，人在天涯忆帝乡。\n貌得西方金粟影，大江东去泛慈航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别吴文中 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"吴郎归骑入长干，窈窕佳人咏合欢。\n若问荔枝何所似，胭脂香染水晶寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"象教精舍为孔阳宗作","author":"佘翔","text":"金仙何日至西方，七宝林开古豫章。\n见说自焚三昧火，至今时现玉毫光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴任德","author":"佘翔","text":"溪流日暮锁寒烟，石马桥头夜泊船。\n不识名园开曲水，怀人几度对婵娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵曲四首赠大司马吴公 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"秣陵宫阙旧长安，车骑如云拥汉官。\n司马勋名深帝眷，貔貅千万独登坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad0