author":"佘翔","text":"峡江片片锦帆开，谁抱凌云作赋才。\n迟尔凤凰山下客，乘风还上钓龙台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范子受宅赏牡丹","author":"佘翔","text":"谁家亭榭似平章，花媚东风冠洛阳。\n客到但倾光禄酒，扑衣何处不天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏荔枝","author":"佘翔","text":"绛囊颗颗隐珠胎，不向风尘驰骑来。\n自劈凝脂沉碧水，大秦明月掌中回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈灵翊","author":"佘翔","text":"片月亭亭挂碧霄，扁舟夜趁海门潮。\n风流何处思公子，寒倚花前斗柳腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立雨叔餐秀园 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"春生薜荔翠交加，高捲湘帘览物华。\n一曲溪流堪濯锦，有时流出武陵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立雨叔餐秀园 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"竹香细细午风柔，高枕沧浪事事幽。\n散帙挥毫过白日，嘤嘤灌木鸟相求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题立雨叔餐秀园 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"一室多藏小酉书，草名书带满庭除。\n夜来太乙高相照，彩笔如椽赋子虚。","collecti